ake  every experiencing to play some sanity  that's the whole point of it in terms of  like power-ups and stuff like that like  how does the gameplay flow like it yeah  you get like a upgrades here to your  character stuff like that what do you do  players move us so move us our Apothic  hero  so you gets unleashed so when you  unleash some sanity you basically can  choose one unleashes in the game we deal  enough damage on your opponent's your  unleash bar is gonna fill up and then  you use your ultimate there so you could  turn to a shark have harpoons rain from  the sky so you have all these things  that you can unlock so we have 13  unleashes they can do so we're running  about six of our game right now in this  booth but when you go in the game and  collect more and you have all the  experience that you could unlock and you  can do it it is it a game you can play  couch co-op as well as its online  multiplayer what we were trying to bring  to the game right was like all the  classic features that we loved about 90s  videogames  we're 90s boys man we wanted to bring  that forward merge it with the modern  day technologies that we have and so  yeah whether you sit down again local or  online you're gonna be able to add a lot  of focus for sanity I tell you right now  guys your story mirrors our story we  grew up together loving video games we  decided that you know what let's have a  podcast let's talk about games and this  is where we are that's what we're doing  now just followed in our passion so us  guys if you have not seen swim sanity  and you're at PAX East come over here  and show these guys some love the game  looks amazing at first glance it looks  like just a small multiplayer game and  there's a whole heck of a lot more to it  so guys check out swim sanity thank you  so much guys

